/* File: stories/<slug>/screenplay.fountain
   Fountain rules used here:
   - Scene headings start with INT. or EXT. (or force with a leading period).
   - Character names in CAPS on their own line; dialogue directly below.
   - Parentheticals in (parentheses) on their own line, only for action or a reaction that changes the line.
   - Interruptions end with a double hyphen: --
   - Transitions end in TO: and are used rarely; cuts are implied.
   - Present tense. No "we see". No camera directions except essential INSERT or POV.
   - Never the em dash character.
   - Dual dialogue: add ^ after the second character name.
   - Notes to self in [[double brackets]] are not printed. */

